                                                "sense_id": "43053248-1bb6-336f-ae5d-b6850c915222",
                                                "text": "And than he shall be riched ſo,\nThat it may faile nevermo"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37b69575-8bbf-4b0e-9629-176987336c18",
                                                "sense_id": "43053248-1bb6-336f-ae5d-b6850c915222",
                                                "text": "With shadowy forests and with champains rich'd"
                                            }
